      <p>My career has been built in financial services, leading teams and delivering mission-critical capabilities across complex technology, legacy integration and regulatory environments.</p>
      <p>My foundation is in retail credit decisioning, software engineering, solution architecture and enterprise delivery.</p>
      <p>That technical grounding shapes how I lead today. I believe meaningful transformation requires more than strategy or technology alone. It requires understanding the business problem, making sound architectural decisions, developing capable teams and taking accountability for the outcomes.</p>
      <p>I think in systems, trade-offs, evidence and outcomes.</p>
      <p class="about-emphasis">I'm most useful where complexity is high, the stakes are real, and technology is changing what's possible.</p>
